            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Driving"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "也可以随时在“今天”页右上角手动记录一段。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can also record a stretch manually anytime from the top right of Today."
