            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Manual Only"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅手动：只在你从“今天”页开始记录时使用位置，结束后完全不定位。不需要“始终允许”位置权限。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Manual only: location is used only while a recording you started from Today is running, and not at all after it ends. “Always” location access isn't needed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今天": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
