            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Starting Now"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从现在起全天记录的轨迹和地点会自动收进这段旅程，回来后在旅程里点“结束旅程”。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Routes and places from all-day recording go into this trip from now on. When you're back, tap End Trip in the trip."
