    },
    "你可以在“设置 › 删除所有数据”中永久删除所有轨迹、地点、旅程和照片，删除会同步到你的所有设备和 iCloud。卸载 App 会删除本机数据；iCloud 中的数据可以在 iOS“设置 › Apple 账户 › iCloud › 管理存储空间”中删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can permanently delete all tracks, places, trips and photos in Settings › Delete All Data; the deletion syncs to all your devices and iCloud. Deleting the app removes the data on that device; data in iCloud can be removed in iOS Settings › Apple Account › iCloud › Manage Storage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你在这里拍了 %lld 张照片": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "You took %lld photo here"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "You took %lld photos here"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你好像在%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Looks like you're in %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你想怎么记录？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How do you want to record?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你拍过的照片和视频里记着当时的地点。漫迹会找出这些地方，点亮去过的城市、省份和国家，并放进那一天的时间线。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your photos and videos remember where they were taken. Waytrace finds those places, lights up the cities, provinces and countries you have been to, and adds them to that day's timeline."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你添加到旅程中的照片会被压缩后保存在 App 中并同步到你的 iCloud。App 只能访问你在系统照片选择器里选中的照片。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Photos you add to trips are compressed, stored in the app and synced to your iCloud. The app can only access the photos you pick in the system photo picker."
          }
        }
      }
    },
