    "只在你点“开始记录”时记录，适合旅行、徒步和骑行。其他时间完全不使用位置。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Records only after you tap “Start Recording” — great for trips, hikes and rides. The rest of the time, your location isn't used at all."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只属于你": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yours Alone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只读取时间和地点，照片不会被上传或复制": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only the time and place are read. Photos are never uploaded or copied."
