            "value": "Sign In to Sync Your Profile"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "登录是可选的。如果你使用“通过 Apple 登录”，App 只保存 Apple 提供的匿名用户标识、你选择分享的名字和邮箱，存放在你的 iCloud 键值存储中，用于在你的设备之间同步资料。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Signing in is optional. If you use Sign in with Apple, the app stores only the anonymous identifier Apple provides and the name and email you choose to share, in your iCloud key-value storage, to keep your profile in sync between your devices."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "登录是可选的，不登录也能使用全部功能。": {
