    "为了显示地点名称、城市和国家，App 会把停留地点的坐标发送给 Apple 地图服务进行反向地理编码和兴趣点查询。这一过程由 Apple 处理，受 Apple 隐私政策约束，不包含你的身份信息。查看一个地点“那天的天空”时，App 会把那里的大致坐标（约 1 公里精度）和日期发送给 Apple 天气服务，取回当天的天气，并只保存在你的设备上。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To show place names, cities and countries, the app sends the coordinates of places you stay to Apple Maps for reverse geocoding and point-of-interest lookups. Apple handles this under its privacy policy, and no information about who you are is included. When you look at a place's \"That day's sky\", the app sends its rough coordinates (to about 1 km) and the date to Apple Weather to fetch that day's weather, which is kept only on your device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
